  "editorial": {
    "name": "primefaces/primeicons",
    "descriptionZh": "Prime UI 系列组件库配套的图标集，仓库里是 fonts/、raw-svg/ 两份图标源文件加 primeicons.css。2026 年 6 月被作者归档成只读，README 说明后续开发搬到 PrimeUI。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿图标字体和 raw-svg 源文件，按 CSS class 引用",
    "noteZh": "首屏最上面是一条黄色横幅 This repository was archived by the owner on Jun 28, 2026. It is now read-only.，仓库名旁边挂着 Public archive 标签，右侧 About 只写着 Icon Library for Prime UI Libraries。文件列表把 demo-files、fonts、raw-svg 三个目录和 CHANGELOG.md、LICENSE、demo.html、package.json、primeicons.css、selection.json 一路排下来，README 里写 Existing MIT versions remain MIT, forever，并指向 primeui.dev/nextchapter 和 primeicons.dev。右下角语言统计是 HTML 92.2%、CSS 7.4%、JavaScript 0.4%。",
